  "title": "mysql: Fix handling of old and new style Authentication method Switch Request Packet",
  "description": "The dissection of new and old style auth switch requests was mixed together.\n\nThis added a wrong \"Status\" to the tree and stole the first character of \"Auth Method Name\".\n\nWith this fix:\n![image](/uploads/f4cd27478b9068c4b96a15e773e86d82/image.png)\n\nWithout this fix:\n![image](/uploads/56eb561bb655a55fc660a59b5e22d958/image.png)\n\n[compress_mysql.pcap](/uploads/e3f5d2d9e9a4ab855569a51aa8fd7d4c/compress_mysql.pcap)",
